{"artifact_digest":"sha256:eea16e1f6780cef8990f25f01777bb217cb1dfd3c231145515fcbdae877dcc7e","artifact_path":"objects/sha256/ee/eea16e1f6780cef8990f25f01777bb217cb1dfd3c231145515fcbdae877dcc7e.md","bundle_digest":"sha256:b1d56a56dde68ea21de25f1b729510be09200947018c2fcd8a9b7785b3f95347","bundle_entry_key":"anchored-expansion-peierls-survival-bound","bundle_id":"population.critical-percolation-thinning-bridge-001","claim_kind":"lemma","conditions":[],"domain":"probability theory","draft":"w441/bundle_001.json","evidence_ids":[],"logical_id":"math:probability.percolation.critical:anchored-expansion-peierls-survival-bound","overlay_schema_version":1,"proof_text":"Let C be an infinite connected graph of maximum degree Delta>=2 and o a vertex. Define h(C,o) as the infimum of |boundary_E K|/|K| over finite connected vertex sets K containing o. If h=h(C,o)>0, set a=(1-q)^h. For any q<1 with a<1/(Delta^2+1),

P_q^C(o belongs to an infinite cluster) >= 1 - a/(1-Delta^2 a) > 0.

Proof: impose fixed orders on the countable vertex and neighbor sets. A canonical spanning tree of a connected n-vertex set K containing o has a depth-first walk of length 2(n-1). A walk determines its visited set, so at most Delta^{2(n-1)} such K exist. If the q-open root cluster equals K, all edges of boundary_E K are closed. Independence of the fresh thinning bits bounds this event by (1-q)^{|boundary_E K|}<=a^n. Sum over all finite root clusters: P_q^C(root cluster finite)<=sum_{n>=1}Delta^{2(n-1)}a^n=a/(1-Delta^2 a). The stated restriction makes this strictly below one. No independence between different possible K is assumed; this is a union bound over mutually exclusive exact-cluster events.","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:01f5472ebb869472b5d75049ecf42557b199c6165f836a799d663090e3d82d59","revision_digest":"sha256:040deeb9f71a245af275272df63d7ee64161db80d95333977c224afdc69ea88e","source_id":"owner:w441:P0043:2026-10-10:anchored-expansion-peierls-survival-bound","source_revision":"draft-as-written-2026-10-10","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

